 trial, the trial keeps running and its end bills the new plan. Sending ",[295,1324,1325],{},"invoiceImmediately: true",[295,1327,1328],{},"anchor",[295,1330,1331],{},"resetAnchor",[295,1333,628],{}," or a plan with a different interval with ",[295,1336,1287],{}," returns ",[295,1339,1340],{},"422",[274,1342,1343,1348,1352],{},[292,1344,1345],{},[295,1346,1347],{},"applyImmediately",[292,1349,1350],{},[295,1351,367],{},[292,1353,1354,1355,1357,1358,1360],{},"Apply the change now (",[295,1356,1280],{},") or at the end of the current period (",[295,1359,1287],{},", default).",[274,1362,1363,1368,1372],{},[292,1364,1365],{},[295,1366,1367],{},"invoiceImmediately",[292,1369,1370],{},[295,1371,367],{},[292,1373,1374,1375,1377,1378,1380,1381,1383,1384,1386,1387,1393],{},"Generate and charge a proration invoice immediately. Only applies when ",[295,1376,1347],{}," and ",[295,1379,1270],{}," are both ",[295,1382,1280],{},". Defaults to ",[295,1385,1287],{},", which parks the proration delta on the current cycle and bills it as a line on the next renewal invoice (and waives it if the subscription is cancelled first). ",[1174,1388,1389,1390,1392],{},"Set this to ",[295,1391,1280],{}," on yearly and other long-interval plans",", where the deferral to the next renewal costs you the most.",[274,1395,1396,1400,1404],{},[292,1397,1398],{},[295,1399,1328],{},[292,1401,1402],{},[295,1403,516],{},[292,1405,1406,1407,1410,1411,327],{},"Set the billing anchor to a specific date (",[295,1408,1409],{},"YYYY-MM-DD",", UTC). Cannot be combined with ",[295,1412,1331],{},[274,1414,1415,1419,1423],{},[292,1416,1417],{},[295,1418,1331],{},[292,1420,1421],{},[295,1422,367],{},[292,1424,1425,1426,327],{},"Reset the billing anchor to now. Cannot be combined with ",[295,1427,1328],{},[274,1429,1430,1434,1438],{},[292,1431,1432],{},[295,1433,628],{},[292,1435,1436],{},[295,1437,516],{},[292,1439,1440,1441,327],{},"Extend or set a trial until this date (ISO 8601). Cannot be combined with ",[295,1442